    "console.css: action columns reserve 12rem and align headings/actions left with consistent spacing",
    "ConsoleShell/ConsoleSidebarRail and types: optional dark-theme brand logo, selected by CSS from initial HTML",
    "ConsoleThemeToggle.vue/tests: stable SSR label until mount prevents saved dark-mode hydration mismatch",
    "ConsoleListFilters.vue: normalize all filter buttons to 32px height and 14px text; left-aligned responsive controls",
    "ConsolePagination.vue/types: optional alwaysVisible for the material library and picker, preserving default pagination behavior",
    "Security review: Vue/compiler-sfc 3.5.42 and ECharts 6.1.0; host uses scoped dependency overrides for build tooling fixes",
    "ConsoleTrendChart.vue/types: optional unitPlacement=legend groups units with series labels and removes floating axis units; default axis labels unchanged",
    "ConsoleTrendChart.vue: derive primary-axis bounds from the complete dataset so legend visibility does not remove ticks or grid lines",
    "ConsoleInput.vue: suppress Edge native password reveal only when a custom trailing control is present",
    "console.css: remove global page/card/empty-state entrance translations and scales to keep navigation visually stable",
    "console.css: opt into same-origin cross-document view transitions without sliding or cross-fading the console"
